{"sessions":[{"name":"会话","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"test"},{"role":"user","content":"test"},{"role":"user","content":"тест"},{"role":"assistant","content":"我是一个计算机科学领域的专用 AI 助手，专注于代码调试、架构设计、算法优化等编程技术范畴。请提出您的具体技术需求，我会全力协助。","reasoning":"We need answer in Russian? User says \"тест\". We need check topic. As planner agent for code assistant? The system prompt says we are a planner Agent, output structured plan. But user input \"тест\" is not a technical requirement. The instruction has absolute defense: only if core entity points to computer science. \"тест\" is just test, not CS. We must output exact refusal text: \"我是一个计算机科学领域的专用 AI 助手，专注于代码调试、架构设计、算法优化等编程技术范畴。请提出您的具体技术需求，我会全力协助。\" No extra. So final should be exactly that.","usage":{"prompt_tokens":1000,"completion_tokens":164,"total_tokens":1164}},{"role":"assistant","content":"## 当前状态判定\n\n规划 Agent 在本轮输出中未产生任何可执行的技术方案。其返回内容为空域过滤提示文本，不包含文件清单、类结构、接口签名、数据结构定义或算法流程。因此不存在可供编码 Agent 落地的技术输入。\n\n与此同时，项目文件结构清单为空，源码根目录 `C:/Users/ddpc-win/PycharmProjects/share` 下尚未识别到任何已有包目录（如 controller、service、entity、mapper、config 等）。依据规则 3 与规则 6，新建文件必须落在已存在的包目录下，且启动类需置于 controller、service、entity 同级位置。当前缺少这一最小目录基线，无法确定文件落点。\n\n## 需要补充的技术输入\n\n请提供以下任一项，我将立即生成完整可运行代码。\n\n1. 明确的功能需求描述，包含业务实体、输入输出契约与关键约束。\n2. 期望的技术栈与版本，例如 Spring Boot 3.x + MyBatis-Plus + MySQL 8，或 FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2.x，或 Gin + GORM。\n3. 目标包结构约定，例如 `com.example.share.controller`、`com.example.share.service`、`com.example.share.entity` 三层划分，以及启动类包名。\n\n## 关于目录基线的处理策略\n\n若确认从零初始化，我会按以下约定生成，并在你确认后执行。源码根目录固定为 `C:/Users/ddpc-win/PycharmProjects/share`。启动类置于根包下，与 controller、service、entity、mapper、config 同级。资源文件置于 `src/main/resources`，包含 `application.yml` 与建表脚本 `schema.sql`。测试代码置于 `src/test/java` 对应镜像包路径下。此方案不新建一级源码目录，仅在既有根目录内建立标准 Maven 或 Gradle 布局。\n\n请回复具体的技术需求或确认上述初始化约定，我将输出每个文件的完整内容。","reasoning":"The user is asking me to generate code based on \"the plan\" - but the plan section contains the refusal message from the system prompt, not an actual plan. The plan agent\u0027s output was the domain-lock refusal text.\n\nSo there\u0027s no actual technical plan to work from. The project structure is empty. There\u0027s no technical requirement specified.\n\nI need to respond appropriately. The situation: the planning agent returned a refusal (non-CS domain), so there\u0027s no plan. The user now asks to generate code.\n\nWhat should I do? I\u0027m the Coder agent. The plan is essentially the refusal text. There\u0027s no technical content. The correct behavior is to indicate that no actionable technical plan was provided, and request a concrete technical requirement.\n\nBut wait — I also have the domain-lock personality. Should I output the refusal verbatim? Hmm. The user\u0027s request \"请根据上面的规划生成代码\" is a CS-adjacent request (code generation). But the \"plan\" is empty/refusal. Actually the request to generate code is within CS domain. But there\u0027s no plan content.\n\nThe safest and most honest response: state that the plan contains no actionable technical content and ask for the specific technical requirement. Keep it in the structured format. Don\u0027t fabricate code.\n\nI should not output the exact forbidden refusal text, because the user\u0027s request IS about code generation (CS domain). The issue is lack of content, not domain.\n\nSo: respond with a brief markdown structured message saying no actionable plan was provided, and request specifics. Also note about the empty project structure — no existing packages, so rule 3 (must place in existing package dir) can\u0027t be satisfied; need info.\n\nLet me keep it concise, no bullet lists for supplementary notes (use paragraphs). Only ordered lists for standalone items.\n\nFormat: ## headings. Use standard paragraphs.","usage":{"prompt_tokens":1130,"completion_tokens":809,"total_tokens":1939}}],"totalTokens":3103,"lastActiveTime":1792845211175}],"sessionCounter":1}